{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p155a","title":"曹操招引方术士","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p155a-account","label":"张华《博物志》","text":"《博物志》记曹操招引左慈、华佗、甘始、郄俭等方术之士，皆来。","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"招引","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0406","role":"来应","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0407","role":"来应","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0408","role":"来应","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0409","role":"来应","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"生平补叙","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p155a-q"]},"source_order":[1,1135,"P155a"],"order":453},{"id":"fangji-e-a45abf1469fc4fcbaf21","title":"左慈到，众人竞受其补导之术；至寺人严峻往从问受","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-a45abf1469fc4fcbaf21","label":"裴注·典论","text":"左慈到，众人竞受其补导之术；至寺人严峻往从问受","evidence":["fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0406","role":"到者","evidence":["fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4"]},{"person":"fangji-p-35f05b2b2574ab","role":"往从问受者","evidence":["fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4","order":5917}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0406","name":"左慈","evidence":["wudi-q-p155","fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4","fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p155-wudi-p0406","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p155"]},{"id":"fangji-m-6390343910e4872a78e2","kind":"mention","text":"曹丕《典论》述并议方士及好道者","evidence":["fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-3d508efab419550848d4","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-03fdb056126f24c96814","layer":"pei","quote":"左慈到，又竞受其补导之术；至寺人严峻，往从问受，阉竖真无事于斯术也","attribution":"裴注·典论","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":145,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-d9499780db6b1117e7cf","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-03fdb056126f24c96814","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝《典论》论郤俭等事曰：“颍川郤俭，能辟谷，饵伏苓；甘陵甘始，亦善行气，老有少容；庐江左慈，知补导之术：并为军吏。初，俭之至，市伏苓，价暴数倍。议郎安平李覃，学其辟谷，餐伏苓，饮寒水；中泄利，殆至陨命。后，始来，众人无不鸱视狼顾，呼吸吐纳。军谋祭酒弘农董芬，为之过差，气闭不通，良久乃苏。左慈到，又竞受其补导之术；至寺人严峻，往从问受，阉竖真无事于斯术也。人之逐声，乃至于是。光和中，北海王和平，亦好道术，自以当仙。济南孙邕，少事之，从至京师。会和平病死，邕因葬之东陶；有书百余卷，药数囊，悉以送之。后弟子夏荣，言其尸解；邕至今恨不取其宝书仙药。刘向惑于《鸿宝》之说，君游眩于子政之言，古今愚谬，岂唯一人哉！”","attribution":"裴注引曹丕《典论》","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-66c2e7fedf68bad14c99","start":0,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p155a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d76d672bc0848c8009df","layer":"pei","quote":"招引方术之士，庐江左慈、谯郡华佗、甘陵甘始、阳城郄俭，无不毕至。","attribution":"张华《博物志》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":459,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c928ccff5d542bc3225","start":86,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p155","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d76d672bc0848c8009df","layer":"pei","quote":"张华《博物志》曰：“汉世，安平崔瑗、瑗子寔，弘农张芝、芝弟昶，并善草书；而太祖亚之。桓谭、蔡邕善音乐，冯翊山子道、王九真、郭凯等善围棋；太祖皆与埒能。又好养性法，亦解方药。招引方术之士，庐江左慈、谯郡华佗、甘陵甘始、阳城郄俭，无不毕至。又习啖野葛至一尺，亦得少多饮鸩酒。”","attribution":"张华《博物志》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":459,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c928ccff5d542bc3225","start":0,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
